      "id": "91367867",
      "content_html": "<p><a href=\"http://seldo.com\">@seldo.com</a> I think, at the very least, the basics of programming and the languages are essential to becoming a developer, knowing what you need an LLM to output.</p>\n<p>Vibe coding without strong software knowledge can lead to scandals like the Tea App.</p>\n",
